2026-10-02T15:50:33.2190875Z   ok   release writes nothing for a switch that is not owned, even one that reads on
2026-10-02T15:50:33.2191616Z   ok   release of the configured owned switch: unavailable waits, on writes OFF, off ends ownership without a write
2026-10-02T15:50:33.2192305Z   ok   the configured owned switch, unavailable past the grace, is still waited for
