2026-10-02T15:50:33.2216961Z   ok   crash, restart before the switch loads, unload inside the grace: the record survives the unload and the next setup turns the switch off
2026-10-02T15:50:33.2218104Z   ok   a renamed switch unloaded inside the grace keeps its record, and past the grace the lost repair names it
2026-10-02T15:50:33.2218850Z   ok   an unload OFF that returns but leaves the switch on keeps the record, and the next setup turns it off
